title Settle - High Level Design v3
direction right

Clients [icon: users] {
  Users [icon: users, label: "Users: On-Call, Commander, Scribe, Service Owner, Eng Manager, Admin, Auditor (app roles: Admin, Engineer, Viewer)"]
  WebApp [icon: react, label: "Settle web app (React)"]
  AITools [icon: bot, label: "AI assistant (MCP client)"]
  Customers [icon: globe, label: "Customers (public status page)"]
}

Signal Sources [icon: radar] {
  Probes [icon: radar, label: "Probe agents in 2-3 regions"]
  Jobs [icon: heart-pulse, label: "Scheduled jobs (heartbeat pings)"]
  AlertTools [icon: bell-ring, label: "Monitoring tools and Grafana alert rules"]
  CI [icon: github-actions, label: "GitHub Actions (deploy events)"]
  DemoShop [icon: store, label: "Demo shop with fault switches"]
  UptimeRobot [icon: activity, label: "UptimeRobot (pings health, keeps Render awake)"]
}

Edge [icon: shield] {
  Vercel [icon: vercel, label: "Vercel in production (HTTPS, serves the UI, rewrites /api to Render)"]
  Nginx [icon: server, label: "nginx, the Docker Compose entry point (serves the UI, proxies /api and /webhooks)"]
  Security [icon: lock, label: "Spring Security (checks every request: JWT, tool tokens, personal access tokens; rate limits)"]
}

Backend on Render [icon: server] {
  Auth [icon: key-round, label: "Auth and users (login, roles, personal access tokens)"]
  Monitoring [icon: activity, label: "Monitors and heartbeats (down when 2 regions agree)"]
  Intake [icon: inbox, label: "Alert intake (validate, dedup, group)"]
  Incident [icon: siren, label: "Incident service (core: lifecycle, SLA clocks, roles)", color: orange]
  Timeline [icon: scroll-text, label: "Timeline and audit (append-only)"]
  Catalog [icon: calendar-clock, label: "Catalog and on-call (services, schedules, service map, runbooks)"]
  Deploys [icon: rocket, label: "Deploy tracking"]
  StatusSvc [icon: globe, label: "Status page (optional)"]
  Reporting [icon: bar-chart-3, label: "Postmortems, insights, and search"]
  Telemetry [icon: line-chart, label: "Telemetry queries (server-side token)"]
  Escalation [icon: alarm-clock, label: "Escalation worker (polls every 1 min)"]
  Relay [icon: repeat, label: "Outbox relay (publish, retry)"]
}

Database [icon: database] {
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "PostgreSQL on Supabase (schema incident)"]
  Outbox [icon: archive, label: "outbox table (written in the same transaction)"]
}

Event Bus [icon: rabbitmq] {
  Exchange [icon: rabbitmq, label: "incident-events exchange (RabbitMQ, fan-out)"]
  QInApp [icon: list, label: "in-app-notifications"]
  QLive [icon: list, label: "live-updates"]
  QAI [icon: list, label: "ai-jobs"]
  QEmail [icon: list, label: "email-slack (optional)"]
  DLQ [icon: trash-2, label: "DLQ (failed messages, all queues)"]
}

Async Workers [icon: cpu] {
  NotifWorker [icon: bell, label: "Notification worker (in-app, idempotent by event ID)"]
  WSPusher [icon: radio, label: "WebSocket pusher (live updates to the web app)"]
  AIWorker [icon: bot, label: "AI job worker (saves AI findings as suggestions)"]
  Sender [icon: send, label: "External sender (optional, rate-limited)"]
}

AI Service [icon: python] {
  AIFeatures [icon: sparkles, label: "AI features: find similar, AI SRE, drafting, triage hint (suggest only)"]
  MCPServer [icon: plug, label: "MCP server (read tools, then comment and acknowledge)"]
}

Grafana Cloud [icon: grafana] {
  Prometheus [icon: prometheus, label: "Prometheus (metrics)"]
  Loki [icon: file-text, label: "Loki (logs)"]
}

Models [icon: brain] {
  Ollama [icon: brain, label: "Ollama: LLM and embeddings (default)"]
  Hosted [icon: cloud, label: "Hosted LLM (optional, off by default)"]
}

External [icon: plug] {
  SlackEmail [icon: slack, label: "Slack / Email (optional)"]
  Redis [icon: redis, label: "Redis (optional, pub/sub)"]
}

Users > WebApp
WebApp > Vercel: production
WebApp > Nginx: local
Customers > Vercel: /status
Vercel > Security: /api
Nginx > Security: /api
UptimeRobot > Security: /actuator/health every 10 min
AlertTools > Security: /webhooks/alerts
CI > Security: /webhooks/deploys
Probes > Security: check results
Jobs > Security: heartbeat pings
AITools > MCPServer: personal access token
MCPServer > Security: REST API as the user
Security > Backend on Render: routes

Monitoring > Intake: raise alert
Intake > Incident: create or link
Incident > Timeline: same transaction
Incident - Catalog: who is on call
Deploys > Timeline: deploys in the incident window
Incident --> StatusSvc: approved updates
Incident --> AIFeatures: find similar, triage hint (optional)

Backend on Render > Postgres
Incident > Outbox: event, same transaction
Escalation > Postgres: poll deadlines
Escalation > Outbox: event, same transaction
Relay > Outbox: read unpublished
Relay --> Exchange: publish

Exchange --> QInApp
Exchange --> QLive
Exchange --> QAI
Exchange --> QEmail

QInApp --> DLQ: on failure
QLive --> DLQ: on failure
QAI --> DLQ: on failure
QEmail --> DLQ: on failure

QInApp --> NotifWorker
QLive --> WSPusher
QAI --> AIWorker
QEmail --> Sender

NotifWorker > Postgres: write notification
WSPusher > Redis
Sender > SlackEmail
AIWorker > AIFeatures: investigate
AIFeatures > MCPServer: evidence through MCP tools
AIFeatures > Ollama
AIFeatures --> Hosted: optional

Telemetry > Grafana Cloud: PromQL and LogQL
DemoShop > Grafana Cloud: logs and metrics
DemoShop > CI: deploy events
